          "field": "Acceptance Criteria",
          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "from_string": "# Given a shopper lands on the PDP, when the page loads, then the slide-out is in its closed state and not visible.\n# Given a shopper clicks any of the info links on the PDP (e.g. Details & Care), when the link is clicked, then the slide-out opens from the right-hand and displays the tab corresponding to the link that was clicked.\n# Given the slide-out is open, when a shopper clicks the X at the top right, then the slide-out closes and the shopper remains on the PDP.\n# Given the Details & Care tab is active, when the content loads, then it displays the product-specific details and care instructions sourced from the {{long-description}}and {{careInstructions}} product attributes.\n# Given a shopper navigates between tabs within the slide-out, when a different tab is selected, then the content updates to reflect the selected tab without closing and reopening the slide-out.\n# The slide-out supports the following tabs: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance (plus EU Environmental Qualities on EU/FR storefronts). ",
          "to_string": "# Given a shopper lands on the PDP, when the page loads, then the slide-out is in its closed state and not visible.\n# Given a shopper clicks any of the info links on the PDP (e.g. Details & Care), when the link is clicked, then the slide-out opens from the right-hand and displays the tab corresponding to the link that was clicked.\n# Given the slide-out is open, when a shopper clicks the X at the top right, then the slide-out closes and the shopper remains on the PDP.\n# Given the Details & Care tab is active, when the content loads, then it displays the product-specific details and care instructions sourced from the {{display-name}}, {{long-description}}and {{careInstructions}} product attributes.\n# Given a shopper navigates between tabs within the slide-out, when a different tab is selected, then the content updates to reflect the selected tab without closing and reopening the slide-out.\n# The slide-out supports the following tabs: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance (plus EU Environmental Qualities on EU/FR storefronts). ",
          "from_id": "",
          "to_id": ""
        }
