    {
      "items": [
        {
          "field": "description",
          "fieldtype": "jira",
          "from_string": "*As a* Shopper,\n\n*I want* to access detailed product information in an organised, expandable format on the PDP,\n\n*so that* I can find the information I need without leaving the product page.\n\n----\n\n*Image for reference (Figma is leading):*\n\n!image-20260730-013004.png|width=314,alt=\"image-20260730-013004.png\"!\n\nAfter clicking on the CTA (e.g. “Details & Care), then this slide out selecting the relevant tab that was clicked:\n\n!image-20260720-065922.png|width=791,alt=\"image-20260720-065922.png\"!\n\nThe PDP displays a set of tabs on the slide out, corresponding with the CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content. Content can be managed in Contentful, with the exception of product-specific content sourced from SFCC (e.g. Details & Care, part of Size & Fit).\n\n*Scope:*\n\nThis user story is only for the slide out component and the first Details & Care tab (other tabs covered in separate user stories linked to this).",
          "to_string": "*As a* Shopper,\n\n*I want* to access detailed product information in an organised, expandable format on the PDP,\n\n*so that* I can find the information I need without leaving the product page.\n\n----\n\n*Image for reference (Figma is leading):*\n\n!image-20260730-013004.png|width=314,alt=\"image-20260730-013004.png\"!\n\nAfter clicking on the CTA (e.g. “Details & Care), then this slide out selecting the relevant tab that was clicked:\n\n!image-20260720-065922.png|width=791,alt=\"image-20260720-065922.png\"!\n\nThe PDP displays a set of tabs on the slide out, corresponding with the CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content.\n\n*Scope:*\n\nThis user story is only for the slide out component and the first Details & Care tab (other tabs covered in separate user stories linked to this)."
        }
      ],
