          "field": "Acceptance Criteria",
          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "from_string": "# Given a shopper lands on the PDP, when the page loads, then the slide out is displayed in the collapsed state.\n# Given a shopper clicks one of the links (e.g. Details & Care), then the slide out pops up from the right and displays the selected tab.\n# Given the Details & Care tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays product-specific details and care instructions sourced from SFCC.\n# Given a shopper clicks on 'x' at the top right, then the slide out closes and the shopper is back on the PDP.\n# {color:#ff5630}Given the Shipping & Returns tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays region-specific shipping and returns content managed in Contentful.{color}\n# {color:#ff5630}Given the Assistance tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays: email link, live chat CTA with availability hours, Contact Us link, WhatsApp link, and phone number.{color}\n# {color:#ff5630}Given live chat is unavailable (outside operating hours or all agents unavailable), when the Assistance tab is expanded, then the live chat CTA is suppressed and not shown to the shopper.{color}\n# {color:#ff5630}Given a shopper is on an EU storefront and the product has Environmental Qualities data in SFCC, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is displayed and populated with the product-specific data.{color}\n# {color:#ff5630}Given a shopper is on a non-EU storefront, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not displayed regardless of product data.{color}\n# {color:#ff5630}Given a shopper is on an EU storefront but the product has no Environmental Qualities data in AP21, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not displayed and no empty or placeholder tab renders.{color}",
          "to_string": "1. Given a shopper lands on the PDP, when the page loads, then the slide-out is in its closed state and not visible.\n2. Given a shopper clicks any of the info links on the PDP (e.g. Details & Care, Shipping & Returns), when the link is clicked, then the slide-out opens from the right and displays the tab corresponding to the link that was clicked.\n3. Given the slide-out is open, when a shopper clicks the X at the top right, then the slide-out closes and the shopper remains on the PDP.\n4. Given the Details & Care tab is active, when the content loads, then it displays the product-specific details and care instructions sourced from the careInstructions SFCC product attribute (via AP21).\n5. Given a shopper navigates between tabs within the slide-out, when a different tab is selected, then the content updates to reflect the selected tab without closing and reopening the slide-out.\n6. The slide-out supports the following tabs: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance (plus EU Environmental Qualities on EU/FR storefronts). Content for all tabs except Details & Care is covered in separate user stories: SFCC-102 (Size & Fit), SFCC-267 (Shipping & Returns and Assistance), SFCC-266 (EU Environmental Qualities).",
          "from_id": "",
          "to_id": ""
        }
