          "field": "Dependency",
          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "from_string": "Business: \n\n* Confirm whether \"Find My Size\" is a separate accordion tab in the open state or the same as Size & Fit?\n** they are different tabs - one is for measmerize - one for size tables\n* Confirm whether \"Materials\" is a separate accordion tab\n** it is separate, but it’s rare - where that product has different SKUs - we need validate if the business really wants this - Emma to check with Rebecca\n* Confirm whether the EU Environmental Qualities requirement are a separate tab in EU?\n** Yes, there will be, en-eu and fr-eu (not it,es) - need the ability to turn this on and off per locale. This is product specific, spreadsheet from the sustainability team - Simon and team have a way to import it into AP21. If there’s no info on this on the product, then we have a generic content piece that is defaulted (not product specific) - ideally, we can populate this content by default. To discuss logic with Tim/Mani, is it in SFCC? \n* Confirm which accordion content is sourced from SFCC vs Contentful vs static copy.\n** shipping & returns - region specific\n** assistance - region specific\n* What is the logic to suppress live chat, how can SFCC know whether to display or not?\n** There’s logic today on the chat icon from inside chat - we need to investigate that logic - see if we can apply it to the chat link to dynamically show\n** Action for Emma/Dani to check with Rebecca/Charmaine on how the design should function - how to display to the client - but also ask about chat - currently not on every page - what is the logic here? Appear by default, as is behaviour? Need to get clarity on the positioning - can differ per page so it does not block important details",
          "to_string": "Business: \n\n* Confirm whether \"Find My Size\" is a separate accordion tab in the open state or the same as Size & Fit?\n** they are different tabs - one is for measmerize - one for size tables\n* Confirm whether \"Materials\" is a separate accordion tab\n** it is separate, but it’s rare - where that product has different SKUs - we need validate if the business really wants this - Emma to check with Rebecca\n* Confirm whether the EU Environmental Qualities requirement are a separate tab in EU?\n** Yes, there will be, en-eu and fr-eu (not it,es) - need the ability to turn this on and off per locale. This is product specific, spreadsheet from the sustainability team - Simon and team have a way to import it into AP21. If there’s no info on this on the product, then we have a generic content piece that is defaulted (not product specific) - ideally, we can populate this content by default. To discuss logic with Tim/Mani, is it in SFCC? \n* Confirm which accordion content is sourced from SFCC vs Contentful vs static copy.\n** shipping & returns - region specific\n** assistance - region specific\n* What is the logic to suppress live chat, how can SFCC know whether to display or not?\n** There’s logic today on the chat icon from inside chat - we need to investigate that logic - see if we can apply it to the chat link to dynamically show\n** ",
