          "field": "Acceptance Criteria",
          "fieldtype": "custom",
          "from_string": "1. Given a shopper lands on the PDP, when the page loads, then all accordion tabs are displayed in the collapsed state.\n2. Given a shopper clicks an accordion tab, when the tab is activated, then it expands to reveal its content and any previously open tab collapses.\n3. Given the Details & Care tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays product-specific details and care instructions sourced from AP21 for the active product.\n4. Given the Size & Fit tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays product-specific size and fit information sourced from AP21 for the active product.\n5. Given the Shipping & Returns tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays region-specific shipping and returns content managed in Contentful.\n6. Given the Assistance tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays: email link, live chat CTA with availability hours, Contact Us link, WhatsApp link, and phone number.\n7. Given live chat is unavailable (outside operating hours or all agents unavailable), when the Assistance tab is expanded, then the live chat CTA is suppressed and not shown to the shopper.\n8. Given a shopper is on an EU storefront and the product has Environmental Qualities data in AP21, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is displayed and populated with the product-specific data.\n9. Given a shopper is on a non-EU storefront, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not displayed regardless of product data.\n10. Given a shopper is on an EU storefront but the product has no Environmental Qualities data in AP21, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not displayed and no empty or placeholder tab renders.\n11. Given a content editor updates Shipping & Returns content in Contentful, when the change is published, then it is reflected in the accordion without a code deployment.",
          "to_string": "# Given a shopper lands on the PDP, when the page loads, then all accordion tabs are displayed in the collapsed state.\n# Given a shopper clicks an accordion tab, then the modal pops up on the right and displays the selected tab.\n# Given the Details & Care tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays product-specific details and care instructions {color:#ff5630}sourced from SFCC for the active product.{color}\n# Given the Shipping & Returns tab is expanded, when it renders, then it displays {color:#ff5630}region-specific shipping and returns content managed in Contentful.{color}\n# Given the Assistance tab is expanded, when it renders,{color:#ff5630} then it displays: email link, live chat CTA with availability hours, Contact Us link, WhatsApp link, and phone number.{color}\n# Given live chat is unavailable (outside operating hours or all agents unavailable), when the Assistance tab is expanded, then the live chat CTA is suppressed and not shown to the shopper.\n# Given a shopper is on an EU storefront and the product has {color:#ff5630}Environmental Qualities data in SFCC{color}, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is displayed and populated with the product-specific data.\n# Given a shopper is on a non-EU storefront, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not displayed regardless of product data.\n# Given a shopper is on an EU storefront but the product has no Environmental Qualities data in AP21, when the PDP renders, then the Environmental Qualities accordion tab is not displayed and no empty or placeholder tab renders.",
