          "from_string": "*As a* Shopper,\\n\\n*I want* to access detailed product information in an organised, expandable format on the PDP,\\n\\n*so that* I can find the information I need without leaving the product page.\\n\\n---\\n\\nThe PDP displays a set of accordion tabs below the primary CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content. Only one tab can be open at a time. Accordion content is managed in Contentful and does not require a code deployment to update, with the exception of product-specific content sourced from AP21 (e.g. Details & Care, Size & Fit).\\n\\nThe confirmed accordion tabs are: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance. Two additional tabs — Find My Size and Materials — appear in the open state design but their relationship to the closed state tabs is pending design confirmation (see dependencies).\\n\\nThe Environmental Qualities accordion (PRD-009) is an EU-only tab that renders only when the product has the relevant AP21 attribute populated. It must not display for non-EU storefronts or when no environmental data exists for the product.\\n\\nThe Assistance accordion (PRD-022) contains: email link, live chat with availability hours caveat (chat suppressed when Client Services is unavailable), Contact Us link, WhatsApp link, and phone number.",
          "to_string": "*As a* Shopper,\n\n*I want* to access detailed product information in an organised, expandable format on the PDP,\n\n*so that* I can find the information I need without leaving the product page.\n\n----\n\n*Image for reference (Figma is leading):*\n\n!image-20260720-065922.png|width=791,alt=\"image-20260720-065922.png\"!\n\nThe PDP displays a set of accordion tabs below the primary CTAs. Each tab expands inline to reveal its content. Accordion content is managed in Contentful and does not require a code deployment to update, with the exception of product-specific content sourced from SFCC (e.g. Details & Care, Size & Fit).\n\nThe confirmed accordion tabs are: Details & Care, Size & Fit, Shipping & Returns, and Assistance. \n\nThe Environmental Qualities accordion (PRD-009) is an EU-only tab that renders only when the product has the relevant AP21 attribute populated. It must not display for non-EU storefronts or when no environmental data exists for the product."
